      "locked": false,
      "text": "Angular\n    │\n    ▼\nYARP API Gateway\n    │\n    ▼\nMicroservicios\n│\n├── Auth MS\n│     ├─ User\n│     ├─ Role\n│     └─ Permission\n│\n├── Client MS\n│     ├─ Client\n│     ├─ Address\n│     └─ Contact\n│\n├── Account MS\n│     ├─ Account\n│     └─ AccountType\n│\n├── Transaction MS\n│     ├─ Transaction\n│     └─ Transfer\n│\n├── Loan MS\n│     ├─ Loan\n│     ├─ Installment\n│     └─ LoanSimulation\n│\n├── Report MS\n│     ├─ GeneratedReport\n│     └─ ReportHistory\n│\n├── Notification MS\n│     ├─ Notification\n│     └─ EmailLog\n│     └─ Brevo\n│\n└── Legacy COBOL Service\n      └─ COBOL Engine",
      "fontSize": 32.68292682926829,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Angular\n    │\n    ▼\nYARP API Gateway\n    │\n    ▼\nMicroservicios\n│\n├── Auth MS\n│     ├─ User\n│     ├─ Role\n│     └─ Permission\n│\n├── Client MS\n│     ├─ Client\n│     ├─ Address\n│     └─ Contact\n│\n├── Account MS\n│     ├─ Account\n│     └─ AccountType\n│\n├── Transaction MS\n│     ├─ Transaction\n│     └─ Transfer\n│\n├── Loan MS\n│     ├─ Loan\n│     ├─ Installment\n│     └─ LoanSimulation\n│\n├── Report MS\n│     ├─ GeneratedReport\n│     └─ ReportHistory\n│\n├── Notification MS\n│     ├─ Notification\n│     └─ EmailLog\n│     └─ Brevo\n│\n└── Legacy COBOL Service\n      └─ COBOL Engine",
